\right) \right) \\
\equiv \left( 
\begin{array}{c}
\mathcal{R}_{\left\vert \Psi \right\rangle \left\langle \Psi \right\vert
}\left( Y\right) _{11} \\ 
\vdots \\ 
\mathcal{R}_{\left\vert \Psi \right\rangle \left\langle \Psi \right\vert
}\left( Y\right) _{2^{r}2^{r}}%
