}\right] \right) }\left( -1\right) ^{l}\sum_{\mu \in C_{2m}^{\kappa
}}\sum_{v\in C_{2n}^{2k-\kappa }}\pi \left( \mu \right) \pi \left( v\right) 
\func{Pf}\left( \overset{}{\left( \left. a_{\mu \left( 1\right) }\right\vert
a_{\mu \left( 2\right) }\right) ,\cdots ,\left( \left. a_{\mu \left(
