\left( 2n-1\right) }\right\vert a_{\nu \left( 2n\right) }\right) }\right)
\det \left( \overset{}{\left( \left. a_{\mu \left( 2m+1\right) }\right\vert
a_{\nu \left( 2n+1\right) }\right) ,\cdots ,\left( \left. a_{\mu \left(
\kappa \right) }\right\vert a_{\nu \left( \kappa \right) }\right) }\right) ,
