The Jordan algebra metric matrix $\mathfrak{J}$ can be partitioned into
blocks 
\begin{equation}
\mathfrak{J}=\left( 
\begin{array}{cc}
\mathfrak{J}_{11} & \mathfrak{J}_{12} \\ 
\mathfrak{J}_{21} & \mathfrak{J}_{22}%
\end{array}%
\right)
\end{equation}

