}+ix_{1}x_{3}\right) ^{2}=\frac{1}{4}I_{\mathcal{F}%
}+ix_{1}x_{3}-x_{1}x_{3}x_{1}x_{3}=\frac{1}{4}I_{\mathcal{F}}+ix_{1}x_{3}+%
\frac{1}{4}I_{\mathcal{F}}=\frac{1}{2}I_{\mathcal{F}}+ix_{1}x_{3}=a_{1}^{%
\dagger }a_{1}
\end{eqnarray}%
one has 
\begin{eqnarray}
