\item The idempotency condition 
\begin{equation}
a+b+ic=a^{2\ast }+b^{2\ast }-c^{2\ast }+2a\ast b+2ia\ast c+2ib\ast c
\end{equation}%
gives

\begin{enumerate}
\item The zeroth order term idempotency condition 
