\eta _{0}I_{\mathcal{H}_{\mathcal{F}}}=\left( \eta _{0}^{2}+\eta
_{11}^{2}+\eta _{12}^{2}+\eta _{13}^{2}+\eta _{14}^{2}\ +\eta
_{212}^{2}+\eta _{213}^{2}+\eta _{214}^{2}+\eta _{223}^{2}+\eta
_{224}^{2}+\eta _{234}^{2}\right) I_{\mathcal{H}_{\mathcal{F}}}
