_{2}+\eta _{13}\widetilde{x}_{3}+\eta _{14}\widetilde{x}_{4}\right) \\
+ \\
i\left[ -\left( \eta _{212}\eta _{12}+\eta _{214}\eta _{14}+\eta _{213}\eta
